DFlash draft model — attribution
================================

The Swift sources in this directory (Sources/AthenaModels/DFlash/) are a
port of the DFlash speculative-draft model and Gemma4 target adapter from:

    bstnxbt/dflash-mlx
    https://github.com/bstnxbt/dflash-mlx
    Copyright 2026 bstnxbt
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

    Based on DFlash (paper: arXiv:2602.06036).

A copy of the Apache License, Version 2.0 is available at:
    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Portions of the architecture (DFlashDraftModel, DFlashAttention, the
target hidden-state projection, and the Gemma4 target adapter) are
derived from that project's `dflash_mlx/model.py` and
`dflash_mlx/engine/target_gemma4.py`. The MLX-Swift implementation here is
an independent re-expression of that technique; no source files were
copied verbatim.

Drafter weights are NOT distributed with Athena. The operator fetches them
from Hugging Face (the z-lab org, e.g. z-lab/gemma-4-31B-it-DFlash) at
runtime, exactly like any other model weight. Those weights are tagged
Apache-2.0 and, as Gemma derivatives, are additionally governed by
Google's Gemma Terms of Use — the same terms that govern the Gemma target
models Athena already serves.

See docs/decisions/001-dflash-speculative-decoding.md.
